  "description": "🔹 Info\nThe Idle Bandits is a laid-back guild where the focus is on steady progress, not intense grind. We believe in a relaxed, yet consistent approach to gaming. No pressure, just regular and meaningful participation is required.\n\n‎🔹 Requirements\nJust consistency and a desire to have fun! If you&#039;re active, you&#039;re in! 🙌\n‎\n\n🔹 Benefits/services for all guild members ⚒️ just send facecaker a DM\n\n       Forging level 70 ⚒️\n\n       Alchemy level 75 💎⚗️\n\n‎\n\n🔹 Raids\nEveryday schedule:\nCombat level 40:    7:00PM CT\n\n                 Top Contributor Recognition Program\n\nThis is a work in progress as it is my first time trying to implement a fair reward system. Please feel free to give me suggestions if you think I can make it better.\n\nThe three highest-performing members, determined by guild contributions, deposits, and raid participation, will receive special rewards. Based on a market-value point system guild members will be rewarded points throughout the week on \n\n1000 gold = 1 point \n10000 gold = 10 points\nGuild raid participation = 25 points \n\n\n🥇 250 Cooked GWS and 10 alchemy items of your choice \n\n🥈 100 Cooked GWS and 5 alchemy items of your choice \n\n🥉 50 Cooked GWS and 1 alchemy item of your choice",
